# UI Standards

- Treat approved mockups as design source of truth (`rodha home page UI screen.png`, `cat landing page Ui.png`)
- Use tokens and utilities from `src/app/globals.css` — no inconsistent one-off styles
- Prefer `.btn-primary`, `.card-base`, `.section-spacing`, `Container`, shared UI components
- Avoid inline styles and hardcoded hex/spacing when tokens exist
- Implement responsive layouts from the start (320px → 1536px+)
- Match typography scale (`text-hero` … `text-caption`), orange primary, dark backgrounds

See `docs/knowledge/UI_STANDARDS.md` and `DESIGN_TOKENS.md`.
